{
  "title": "How much? How many?",
  "kind": "grammar",
  "cefr": "A1",
  "estMinutes": 8,
  "intro": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "1. Form"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": true,
      "rows": [
        [
          "question",
          "noun",
          "example"
        ],
        [
          "How many",
          "+ plural countable",
          "How many apples do you want?"
        ],
        [
          "How much",
          "+ uncountable",
          "How much water do you drink?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "2. Prices"
    },
    {
      "type": "rule",
      "title": "How much for prices",
      "points": [
        "How much is it? / How much is this bag? — It's 20 dollars.",
        "How much are they? / How much are these shoes? — They're 35 dollars.",
        "Short: How much? — Ten dollars."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "3. Answers about quantity"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": true,
      "rows": [
        [
          "countable",
          "uncountable"
        ],
        [
          "a lot of / many apples",
          "a lot of / much water"
        ],
        [
          "a few apples",
          "a little water"
        ],
        [
          "no apples / not any",
          "no water / not any"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "rule",
      "title": "much / many in positive sentences",
      "points": [
        "In positive sentences we usually say a lot of: I drink a lot of tea.",
        "much / many are common in questions and negatives: I don't have much time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Be careful!"
    },
    {
      "type": "mistake",
      "wrong": "How much eggs do we need?",
      "right": "How many eggs do we need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "mistake",
      "wrong": "How many money do you have?",
      "right": "How much money do you have?"
    },
    {
      "type": "mistake",
      "wrong": "How much cost this?",
      "right": "How much is this?"
    }
  ],
